  "full_text": "Once upon a time, there was a boy named Tom. He had a toy that he loved very much. One day, he went outside to play.\nAs Tom and his friend, a big bird named Sam came to see the toy. \"Why are you coming?\" asked Tom. Sam said, \"I found it right away and I can't find it.\" Tom felt sad. He wanted to find out where he had to find a new toy.\nTom thought and thought, \"Maybe if it means, then I can find a new toy.\" So Tom flew around the house and started to look for the new toy. He looked and looked, but still not open it. Finally, he found the toy under his bed. Sam was very happy and said, \"Thank you, Tom!\"\nTom took the new toy that he could share his toy with the new toy. They played together and had a great time. Tom was so happy to have his new toy back. They never used the new toy again.\n<|endoftext|>",
